  "content": {
    "id": "p20-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Find the gradient of the tangent to $y=f(x)$ where $x=3$, then find the angle of inclination of these tangents using $\\tan\\theta=m$. Give any non-exact angle to the nearest minute.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^2-5x+2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=1$, $\\theta=45^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f'(x)&=2x-5\\\\m=f'(3)&=2(3)-5\\\\m&=1\\\\\\tan\\theta&=1\\\\\\theta&=45^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^3-3x^2-10x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=-1$, $\\theta=135^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f'(x)&=3x^2-6x-10\\\\m=f'(3)&=3(3)^2-6(3)-10\\\\m&=27-18-10\\\\m&=-1\\\\\\tan\\theta&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nThe angle of inclination satisfies $0^\\circ\\leq\\theta<180^\\circ$, so $\\theta=135^\\circ$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=2x^2-18x$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=-6$, $\\theta\\approx99^\\circ28'$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f'(x)&=4x-18\\\\m=f'(3)&=4(3)-18\\\\m&=-6\\\\\\tan\\theta&=-6\\end{align*}$$\nThe gradient is negative, so the inclination is obtuse.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=180^\\circ-\\tan^{-1}(6)\\\\\\theta&\\approx99^\\circ28'\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      }
    ]
  },
